  "sections": [
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "hero",
      "x": 384,
      "y": 57,
      "width": 1152,
      "height": 978,
      "heading": "Turn words into printable objects.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Your text",
        "Rippled vase",
        "Name keychain",
        "Prism vase",
        "Twisted lantern",
        "Fluted bowl",
        "Poppins",
        "Open in editor"
      ],
      "text": "Turn words into printable objects. Describe an object and Printa builds a real, watertight 3D model. Everything below is compiled live — pick a form, change it, download the STL. Watertight, print-ready Any Google font Free, no sign-up Your text Rippled vase Name keychain Prism vase Twisted lantern Fluted bowl Every form here is a Printa Spec document, compiled to a mesh on request — the same pipeline the editor and the ChatGPT app use. compiling geometry drag to orbit Your text Font Poppins Extrusion 14 mm PRINTA Any Google font, extruded and bevelled. Open in editor Download STL",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#gallery",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 384,
      "y": 1206,
      "width": 1152,
      "height": 1031,
      "heading": "Real models, compiled on this page",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "STL",
        "About",
        "Use this",
        "Browse every place"
      ],
      "text": "Real models, compiled on this page Type, vessels and lattices — and whole cities, captured from photogrammetry or mapped outlines. Every tile is a live STL, not a screenshot. compiling geometry drag to orbit Sydney CBD Place · Surface Photogrammetric surface — towers, trees and the harbour edge, captured from Google 3D tiles. STL About compiling geometry drag to orbit Midtown Manhattan Place · Mapped Mapped outlines — OpenStreetMap footprints extruded into crisp blocks over sampled ground. STL About compiling geometry drag to orbit Downtown San Francisco Place · Mapped Mapped outlines on genui",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#templates",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2237,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1050,
      "heading": "Start from one of 100 templates",
      "backgroundColor": "#F5F5F5",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Helix twist vase",
        "Use this",
        "STL",
        "Voronoi pendant shade",
        "42",
        "House number",
        "Hex pen tray",
        "Lattice cube"
      ],
      "text": "Start from one of 100 templates Vases, lampshades, signs, desk organisers, jewellery, lattices and planters — each one a document rather than a mesh, so every dimension is still yours to change. Helix twist vase Eight ribs carried around the vase by a 240° twist. Use this STL Voronoi pendant shade A cell-wall shade that casts a scattered, organic pattern. Use this STL 42 House number Three large digits with a mounting backplate. Use this STL Hex pen tray A shallow six-sided tray for pens, clips and keys. Use this STL Lattice cube A 70 mm seeded strut lattice — light, rigid, no infill needed. U",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#faq",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 576,
      "y": 3287,
      "width": 768,
      "height": 810,
      "heading": "Common questions",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "Common questions Are the models actually printable? Every model is compiled to a closed, watertight solid with printable wall thicknesses, and the STL you download is generated from the same document you see turning on the page. Nothing here is a scan or a decorative mesh that needs repairing first. Do I need an account? No. The editor, the templates, the city captures and STL export are free and need no sign-up. Models you save stay in your own browser. Can I change a template, or is it fixed? A template is a model document, not a mesh — so the wall thickness, height, segment count, font and ",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
